S('ch13','scale_policy',r'Based on the severity assessment:\n\n\| Scale Mass.*?virtually eliminating the BaSO₄ scaling risk\.', 'Use the predicted supersaturation and upper-bound precipitate mass to select laboratory compatibility and dynamic deposition tests. There is no universal mg/L threshold below which inhibitor is unnecessary. Compare continuous dosing, squeeze treatment and sulfate-removal options using measured inhibitor performance, residual sulfate, formation-water chemistry and injection history; sulfate removal reduces risk but cannot guarantee zero scale.')
